<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:gx="http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2">
<Document>
	<name>UC Berkeley Student Housing · 4 projects · spirals · 08-30 13:07</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Every UC housing project flagged uc_project in v2, flown north to south. Opens east of the Campanile, then at each site ONE DESCENDING ORBIT: 48 s for 1.0 turn, dropping 20 m to roof + 10 m with the camera tilted 66-76 degrees throughout -- no look-down. It then climbs 25 m before crossing to the next. UC housing is counted in BEDS, not units. Altitudes derive from each building's extrusion in geometry.kml, so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Camera-only: run build_tour_package.py to splice the geometry.]]></description>
